* MG.Cycles               (int) = 1        Number of cycles (1 for V-cycle, 2 for W-cycle)
* MG.Levels               (int) = 3        Number of multigrid levels (default: = Refinements)
* MG.PostSmooth           (int) = 1        Number of post-smoothing steps
* MG.PreSmooth            (int) = 1        Number of pre-smoothing steps
* MG.Smoother          (string) = GaussSeidel
                                           Multigrid smoother (Richardson, Jacobi, GaussSeidel, IncompleteLU)
* Preconditioners      (string) = no prec,Jacobi,symm. Gauss-Seidel
                                           Preconditioners to try (comma-separated list, e.g. Jacobi,ILU) or 'all'. Available: no prec, Jacobi, Gauss-Seidel, rev. Gauss-Seidel, symm. Gauss-Seidel, Richardson, ILU, multigrid
* Primals              (string) = c        IETI primal constraints (c=corners, e=edges, f=faces)
* Refinements             (int) = 3        Number of uniform h-refinement steps to perform before solving
* SkipIETI_noprec        (bool) = 0        Skip the unpreconditioned IETI-DP variant (CG without scaled-Dirichlet preconditioner)
* Solver.MaxIterations    (int) = 1000     Maximum iterations for all iterative solvers
* Solver.Tolerance       (real) = 1e-08    Stopping criterion for all iterative solvers
* Solvers              (string) = CG,GMRES,Multigrid
                                           Solvers to try (comma-separated list, e.g. CG,GMRES,MinRes) or 'all'. Available: CG, MinRes, MinRes-QLP, GMRES, BiCGStab, Gradient, Multigrid
* SplitPatches            (int) = 0        Split every patch that many times in 2^d patches
* SquareDiscretization (string) = global   Element equalisation: off (native, lightest, conforming inputs only) | global (all patches identical, always safe)
* StretchGeometry        (real) = 1        Stretch geometry in x-direction by the given factor
* num_run                 (int) = 10       Number of times every solve is repeated; the reported solve time is the mean over the repeats (setup is measured once)
* plot                   (bool) = 0        Write geometry, source and solution to Paraview files

